  "_comment": [
    "Virtual device hardware descriptors — the single source for the Rust",
    "backend (include_str!), the pre-boot config UI and the compositor.",
    "Do not duplicate this list in JS or Rust.",
    "",
    "These are hardware facts only. The OS classifies the form factor itself",
    "from geometry + input_model (apps/shared/form-factor.js); the emulator",
    "never declares a form factor.",
    "",
    "nav_mode  = on-screen navigation chrome the emulator draws",
    "            gesture | softkeys | hardware | none",
    "input_model = primary input hardware, passed to the OS as a hint",
    "            touch | dpad | crown | mouse-keyboard | touch-rotary | touch-keypad",
    "screen_*  = panel resolution reported to the OS",
    "frame_*   = on-screen size of the device frame in the emulator window"
